33540"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-06-12T17:58:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2065493871518470389"],"id":"2065493871518470389","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":49,"impression_count":216836,"like_count":220,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":122,"retweet_count":1},"text":"回国见了一个X上做线下的妹子，\n门槛也没收我的，\n感觉服务和敬业度比日本妹子还要高很多啊…\n为啥会有人跟我说中文区妹子态度不好？\n我是不是不该用我自己的号去约比较好…","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2065493871518470389"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-06-12T11:20:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2065393861535613180"],"id":"2065393861535613180","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":541,"impression_count":282970,"like_count":479,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":294,"retweet_count":23},"text":"真心感觉docomo的ahamo就是神卡!!!\n30gb流量在国内随便用，\n直接连外网，翻墙都不用，\n在国内毫无防火墙的感觉。","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2065393861535613180"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-06-12T05:32:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2065306109272104985"],"id":"2065306109272104985","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":37244,"like_count":40,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":19,"retweet_count":0},"text":"回国航班人是真的多啊…😌 https://t.co/7bMxecA1jt","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2065306109272104985"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-06-11T11:23:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2065032045303325026"],"id":"2065032045303325026","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":31582,"like_count":38,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":1},"text":"大阪现在是药妆店之城😀 https://t.co/pHSsiktdqx","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2065032045303325026"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-06-10T06:23:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2064594177409839368"],"id":"2064594177409839368","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":30521,"like_count":55,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":61,"retweet_count":0},"text":"现在X上有些人，\n别人说啥他都信，\n还有些人，\n别人说啥他都不信…\n其实上外网，需要的是思考…","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2064594177409839368"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-06-10T05:30:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2064580903985430538"],"id":"2064580903985430538","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":75,"impression_count":78020,"like_count":139,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":58,"retweet_count":4},"text":"尽管一分钱一分货，\n但有时候便宜的玩法也确实挺有意思的。 https://t.co/k3rtkeZrVE","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2064580903985430538"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-06-09T04:05:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2064197187236733376"],"id":"2064197187236733376","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":93,"impression_count":198708,"like_count":781,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":394,"retweet_count":12},"text":"和日本女孩子接触，\n最重要的一点，\n不要把她们对你的夸奖太当回事。","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2064197187236733376"},{"article":{"title":"网黄的自我修养（13）图片作为名片：视觉印象与风格统一 "},"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-06-09T02:13:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2064169024687362127"],"id":"2064169024687362127","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":15,"impression_count":29490,"like_count":19,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":38,"retweet_count":2},"text":"https://t.co/Ust4qudWqf","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2064169024687362127"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-06-08T14:56:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2063998540213621081"],"id":"2063998540213621081","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":26251,"like_count":102,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":122,"retweet_count":0},"text":"不知道你们有没有这么一种感觉，\n就是自己一个人，\n啥也不干往那一坐吃点东西就是开心，\n是那种发自肺腑的开心。\n年轻时候工作没办法还要跟人来往社交。\n这份发自肺腑的开心就很少。\n现在完全可以不用社交，\n就一个人吃饭喝酒，\n每天都开心到不行… https://t.co/TgFiuFuQ8n","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2063998540213621081"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-06-08T04:56:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2063847644284539023"],"id":"2063847644284539023","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":39,"impression_count":60621,"like_count":163,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":144,"retweet_count":0},"text":"想知道日本AI应用能力最简单的认证方法，\n你们去日本坐一次出租车，\n在出租车后座的屏幕上，\n都会看到很多介绍日本AI企业应用的广告，\n你就知道日本的AI应用层的能力，\n在什么程度了…\n就那些AI应用的企业，\n在国内都活不过一个月。\n随便来个会用codex的，\n都能给复刻一个…","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2063847644284539023"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-06-08T02:36:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2063812506297241609"],"id":"2063812506297241609","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":17,"impression_count":57085,"like_count":87,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":88,"retweet_count":3},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2063588411177685203","type":"quoted"}],"text":"你会用ChatGPT搜资料在日本都算AI人才。日本对AI方面真心太不卷了… https://t.co/GeQ3xY1rUh","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2063812506297241609"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-06-07T05:47:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2063498116872229261"],"id":"2063498116872229261","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":23,"impression_count":42097,"like_count":114,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":78,"retweet_count":4},"text":"好多人私信让我帮他们在日本找工作，\n你好歹发个履历或是自己的简介给我啊？\n我好歹能看到自己或是身边朋友有需要的话，我就约着面试看看。\n啥也不发，就说让我帮你找个工作，\n就冲着沟通能力和情商，\n就不适合我这边的工作。\n\n还有一些让我帮忙介绍工作的，\n我打开他们的X主页一看，","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2063498116872229261"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-06-07T01:57:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2063440143105839148"],"id":"2063440143105839148","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":17,"impression_count":33256,"like_count":76,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":62,"retweet_count":1},"text":"你们知道你们做黄为什么收入不高吗？\n我翻开很多推文查阅，这些推文日期连贯，歪歪斜斜的每篇上都写着“骚浪贱淫”几个字。\n我横竖睡不着，仔细看了半夜，才从字缝里看出字来。\n满推都写着两个字是“给钱”！","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2063440143105839148"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-06-06T08:00:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2063169241977958419"],"id":"2063169241977958419","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":47615,"like_count":61,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":68,"retweet_count":0},"text":"御殿场奥特莱斯的中国人，肉眼可见的减少… https://t.co/91DFm0EUyA","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2063169241977958419"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-06-06T04:08:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2063110729306407294"],"id":"2063110729306407294","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":99,"impression_count":98677,"like_count":182,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":23,"retweet_count":3},"text":"说真的，现在日本这些性感按摩的环境真的比以前好太多了，\n二十年前我刚来日本的时候，\n那时候マンションエス还没那么火的时候，\n要做这些全要去店铺里，\n然而这种店铺大部分都是中国东北福建那边的大姐经营，\n有在做按摩的时候从你钱包里抽钱的，\n有给你做到一半突然跟你说让你加钱降落的，\n再后来，","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2063110729306407294"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-06-05T02:21:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2062721406568476897"],"id":"2062721406568476897","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":15,"impression_count":53695,"like_count":105,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":35,"retweet_count":3},"text":"不光男生可以去风俗店找女孩子，\n女孩子也可以去风俗店找男孩子。\n\n只是我见的女性向风俗店的男孩子一个比一个帅，\n但是男性向的风俗店…\n什么奇怪的都能看到…","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2062721406568476897"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-06-04T04:01:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2062384337098784872"],"id":"2062384337098784872","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":21,"impression_count":51294,"like_count":152,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":46,"retweet_count":5},"text":"国内好多老板跑过来喜欢跟我出去玩，\n玩一圈之后就喜欢说，\n我在国内这么努力工作，\n就是为了过上你这样的生活…\n每次听他们这么一说，\n我就感觉既然赚钱是为了活的开心，\n那我直接活得开心不就好了吗？\n有没有钱也就变得没那么重要了。","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2062384337098784872"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-06-04T02:04:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2062345193920372738","2062354860675355015"],"id":"2062354860675355015","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":25389,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":0},"text":"大阪需要招一个会用indesign或CDR以及懂印刷的人。 https://t.co/XN8oRXXVqi","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2062354860675355015"}],"includes":{"tweets":[{"author_id":"1184604983011901440","created_at":"2026-06-14T10:49:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2066110704659423390"],"id":"2066110704659423390","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1422,"impression_count":10474720,"like_count":10152,"quote_count":425,"reply_count":932,"